OL,3,GNEWSASerial rapist police officer
OL,4,Apassed vetting despite warnings, BBC
OL,5,Areveals
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer - who was later
OL,8,Fexposed as a violent serial rapist -
OL,9,Fpassed vetting checks to join the force
OL,10,Fdespite having two reports of criminal
OL,11,Fbehaviour against women on his record,
OL,12,FBBC Disclosure can reveal.
OL,14,FAlan Greer was investigated by police
OL,15,Fin 2002 and 2005 for making
OL,16,Finappropriate phone calls to women,
OL,17,Fwith one case resulting in a formal
OL,18,Fpolice caution.
OL,20,FHe was accepted into Strathclyde Police
OL,21,Fin 2009, despite vetting staff being
OL,22,Faware of his previous offending.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
