OL,5,Areveals
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe revelation comes a month after
OL,8,FPolice Scotland told the BBC there had
OL,9,Fbeen no "missed opportunities over the
OL,10,Fyears" to identify Greer's offending
OL,11,Fsooner.
